### First page, 5 per page (newest first)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/post?pageNo=0&pageSize=5

### Second page
GET http://localhost:8080/api/post?pageNo=1&pageSize=5

### Search by title (case-insensitive)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/post?pageNo=0&pageSize=5&query=CHICKEN

### Bad params are clamped -> pageNo 0, pageSize 50
GET http://localhost:8080/api/post?pageNo=-3&pageSize=100000

### One post by id (uses postId saved by create-post.http)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/post/{{postId}}

### Post doesn't exist -> 404
GET http://localhost:8080/api/post/999999
